(7569838, 1215006, 65234, '<td valign="top">Pretty scene, but the horizon seems tilted to me and the shadows have no detail on my screen. Maybe a slightly longer exposure would have gotten more of that detail?</td>', 'Pretty scene, but the horizon seems tilted to me and the shadows have no detail on my screen. Maybe a slightly longer exposure would have gotten more of that detail?', '2018-06-01 09:50:13.000000', NULL, 1),
