(7569961, 1215220, 59737, '<td valign="top">Good subject matter for May, at least from US standpoint.  Capturing the placing of the flowers or maybe a tighter crop from a different angle would have made this stronger for me, but you need to take what''s given when capturing this style without interrupting.</td>', 'Good subject matter for May, at least from US standpoint.  Capturing the placing of the flowers or maybe a tighter crop from a different angle would have made this stronger for me, but you need to take what''s given when capturing this style without interrupting.', '2018-06-01 22:22:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(7569963, 1215021, 59737, '<td valign="top">Strong graphic quality , I like the limited pallette and the strong vertical and horizontal neatly divide the image, think having the lamp and man further to the right or facing the the right would have made this stronger.</td>', 'Strong graphic quality , I like the limited pallette and the strong vertical and horizontal neatly divide the image, think having the lamp and man further to the right or facing the the right would have made this stronger.', '2018-06-01 22:31:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(7569964, 1214871, 59737, '<td valign="top">Clean image, I probably would have cloned out the branch upper left and it bothers me a little that the reflection doesn''t have the same space above the dome.</td>', 'Clean image, I probably would have cloned out the branch upper left and it bothers me a little that the reflection doesn''t have the same space above the dome.', '2018-06-01 22:34:09.000000', NULL, 1),
