(7570459, 1214996, 173844, '<td valign="top">Wonderful other-worldly (figuratively speaking) image.  By drone, I guess, and put to such artistic use rather than the more common birds-eye overview.  Compelling story.  All that lovely beige.  Is that track to the left where your vehicle pulled off to be out of the shot?  But where, then, are the incoming tracks?  Great stuff.<br/>Personal favorite of the challenge.</td>', 'Wonderful other-worldly (figuratively speaking) image.  By drone, I guess, and put to such artistic use rather than the more common birds-eye overview.  Compelling story.  All that lovely beige.  Is that track to the left where your vehicle pulled off to be out of the shot?  But where, then, are the incoming tracks?  Great stuff.Personal favorite of the challenge.', '2018-06-06 15:01:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(7570464, 1215021, 173844, '<td valign="top">There''s so much to this almost-silhouette.  First is the wonderful composition.  The few graphic components are all superb.  The man is deftly and intriguingly positioned.  Is that green horizontal a treeline?  Excellent. The shading of the lamp --  a vision in itself.  The overall green-yellow tone works in such fine fashion that I can hardly imagine it being otherwise.  Even the dark foreground is elegantly striped, however dimly.  The title, too, is great.  I''ll stop here, having run out of superlatives.<br/>I''ve already put forward a personal favorite, but now I''m saying there are a pair of co-favorites.</td>', 'There''s so much to this almost-silhouette.  First is the wonderful composition.  The few graphic components are all superb.  The man is deftly and intriguingly positioned.  Is that green horizontal a treeline?  Excellent. The shading of the lamp --  a vision in itself.  The overall green-yellow tone works in such fine fashion that I can hardly imagine it being otherwise.  Even the dark foreground is elegantly striped, however dimly.  The title, too, is great.  I''ll stop here, having run out of superlatives.I''ve already put forward a personal favorite, but now I''m saying there are a pair of co-favorites.', '2018-06-06 15:23:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(7570472, 1215009, 173844, '<td valign="top">Fine title for this scene of ominous incoming weather, even as the background strip of mountains is raked by sunbeams.  I love the immensity of this image.  The colors form a tight palette used to encompass the entire world.  The scene darkens to the right, as if the promise of the clouds is about to be made good.  Strong.</td>', 'Fine title for this scene of ominous incoming weather, even as the background strip of mountains is raked by sunbeams.  I love the immensity of this image.  The colors form a tight palette used to encompass the entire world.  The scene darkens to the right, as if the promise of the clouds is about to be made good.  Strong.', '2018-06-06 16:47:30.000000', NULL, 1),
