(7570669, 1215199, 173844, '<td valign="top">This could easily be a scene from the distant future, yet here we are today.  Perplexing.  Good move to go black and white, somehow it seems more real.  The weather casts the entire mood.  A lot of white outlines.</td>', 'This could easily be a scene from the distant future, yet here we are today.  Perplexing.  Good move to go black and white, somehow it seems more real.  The weather casts the entire mood.  A lot of white outlines.', '2018-06-07 15:36:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(7570670, 1215236, 173844, '<td valign="top">The swans are charming, but the water is sumptuous and mesmerizing.  These beautiful colors work well with the white and gray birds.  The star-like highlights move this image to an enchanting realm.</td>', 'The swans are charming, but the water is sumptuous and mesmerizing.  These beautiful colors work well with the white and gray birds.  The star-like highlights move this image to an enchanting realm.', '2018-06-07 15:42:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(7570675, 1214853, 173844, '<td valign="top">The lowered clouds add mysterious atmosphere to the already dramatic mountains.  Nice detail in the foreground.  My eye tends to focus on the central rock "finger"; I wonder if it would be less dominant if some part of the image were to be cropped from the left.  Just a thought.</td>', 'The lowered clouds add mysterious atmosphere to the already dramatic mountains.  Nice detail in the foreground.  My eye tends to focus on the central rock "finger"; I wonder if it would be less dominant if some part of the image were to be cropped from the left.  Just a thought.', '2018-06-07 16:14:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(7570676, 1215190, 173844, '<td valign="top">Nice capture of the crucial moment.  I especially like the droplets in the air and the water stalks arising from the water like a clutch of baby Nessies.  Better luck next time.</td>', 'Nice capture of the crucial moment.  I especially like the droplets in the air and the water stalks arising from the water like a clutch of baby Nessies.  Better luck next time.', '2018-06-07 16:19:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(7570679, 1215002, 173844, '<td valign="top">Nicely framed pose of this sweet-looking horse.  The shallow depth of field works well to establish his/her character while making beautiful bokeh of the buttercups.  Good vignette, too.</td>', 'Nicely framed pose of this sweet-looking horse.  The shallow depth of field works well to establish his/her character while making beautiful bokeh of the buttercups.  Good vignette, too.', '2018-06-07 16:26:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(7570680, 1215203, 173844, '<td valign="top">The fruit stand is really colorful, and deserves central billing, yet the surroundings, especially the woman, also contribute greatly to the overall ambiance.  The image feels hyper-real, which I like.  Forgive my ignorance, is this due to processing, or am I way off base?  Fine photo.</td>', 'The fruit stand is really colorful, and deserves central billing, yet the surroundings, especially the woman, also contribute greatly to the overall ambiance.  The image feels hyper-real, which I like.  Forgive my ignorance, is this due to processing, or am I way off base?  Fine photo.', '2018-06-07 16:32:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(7570681, 1214934, 173844, '<td valign="top">Good clean image.  Could very well be a poster epitomizing our current era.</td>', 'Good clean image.  Could very well be a poster epitomizing our current era.', '2018-06-07 16:37:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(7570683, 1215226, 173844, '<td valign="top">Classic pose with great detail and pleasingly framed by the tree trunks and branches.  The robin seems to have your number.  Rich color.</td>', 'Classic pose with great detail and pleasingly framed by the tree trunks and branches.  The robin seems to have your number.  Rich color.', '2018-06-07 16:41:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(7570687, 1215194, 173844, '<td valign="top">This structure always seemed jarring to me, but here it''s given a sympathetic softness by the time of day and your interpretation.  The sky is beautiful.   Nice work.</td>', 'This structure always seemed jarring to me, but here it''s given a sympathetic softness by the time of day and your interpretation.  The sky is beautiful.   Nice work.', '2018-06-07 16:45:23.000000', NULL, 1),
