(7570749, 1214751, 173844, '<td valign="top">This has got to lead to enchantment.  Who wouldn''t want to heedlessly plunge into this forest?  These mushrooms cunningly function as a leading line, highlighted by sunlight, a musical passage.  The central tree seems to be a mythical guardian.  The density and complexity of the foliage is confusing, as if you''ve already drunk the potion.  Black and white is a great choice.  Fine, enjoyable image.</td>', 'This has got to lead to enchantment.  Who wouldn''t want to heedlessly plunge into this forest?  These mushrooms cunningly function as a leading line, highlighted by sunlight, a musical passage.  The central tree seems to be a mythical guardian.  The density and complexity of the foliage is confusing, as if you''ve already drunk the potion.  Black and white is a great choice.  Fine, enjoyable image.', '2018-06-07 23:37:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(7570750, 1215216, 173844, '<td valign="top">Extremely elegant kind of noir black and white.  While Jeeves (is that really his name?) fusses about in the corner, I (the viewer) feel sinister, as if I''m up to no good, to say the least.  It''s a real pleasure to be drawn into the image this way, almost against my will.  The lighting plays a starring role.  The composition is excellent.  A sophisticated piece of stagecraft.</td>', 'Extremely elegant kind of noir black and white.  While Jeeves (is that really his name?) fusses about in the corner, I (the viewer) feel sinister, as if I''m up to no good, to say the least.  It''s a real pleasure to be drawn into the image this way, almost against my will.  The lighting plays a starring role.  The composition is excellent.  A sophisticated piece of stagecraft.', '2018-06-07 23:37:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(7570751, 1214661, 173844, '<td valign="top">From a land far, far away, where fairy tales are real, comes this startling and beautiful image.  Let''s say that there''s a castle on that island in the distance.  And let''s say this tree standing in the water offers magical fruit for those stalwart enough to obtain it.  And so on.  Sign me up.  <br/>The reflections are glorious and make the scene fulfilling.  The reflected cloud is kind of like a spotlight -  maybe even too much so.  Overall, enchanting and stirring.</td>', 'From a land far, far away, where fairy tales are real, comes this startling and beautiful image.  Let''s say that there''s a castle on that island in the distance.  And let''s say this tree standing in the water offers magical fruit for those stalwart enough to obtain it.  And so on.  Sign me up.  The reflections are glorious and make the scene fulfilling.  The reflected cloud is kind of like a spotlight -  maybe even too much so.  Overall, enchanting and stirring.', '2018-06-07 23:37:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(7570752, 1214993, 173844, '<td valign="top">Spectacular scenery.  If -  Spoiler Alert!, subjective assertion ahead, may be harmful to children and some adults  - it is to be marred by the hand of man, this colorful, curious assemblage is an interesting way to go.  Some of the foliage is thrillingly luminous.  Of course processing can aid this quality, but I''m enjoying it nevertheless, and maybe this is true to what we can see.  After all this pettiness, I like the photo and wish it well.</td>', 'Spectacular scenery.  If -  Spoiler Alert!, subjective assertion ahead, may be harmful to children and some adults  - it is to be marred by the hand of man, this colorful, curious assemblage is an interesting way to go.  Some of the foliage is thrillingly luminous.  Of course processing can aid this quality, but I''m enjoying it nevertheless, and maybe this is true to what we can see.  After all this pettiness, I like the photo and wish it well.', '2018-06-07 23:37:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(7570753, 1215005, 173844, '<td valign="top">The bright colors jump out, yet they''re handsomely moderated by the many tree trunks.  When I shift back and squint I enjoy it more so as an abstract than as realism.  Well..., it''s pretty fine both ways.</td>', 'The bright colors jump out, yet they''re handsomely moderated by the many tree trunks.  When I shift back and squint I enjoy it more so as an abstract than as realism.  Well..., it''s pretty fine both ways.', '2018-06-07 23:37:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(7570754, 1215006, 173844, '<td valign="top">If not for the electric lights this could be Dickens'' London, smoke billowing out of the Industrial Revolution.  Fine perspective, interesting composition.  Lush hour of the day.  I like the pink-purple sparkling on the water.</td>', 'If not for the electric lights this could be Dickens'' London, smoke billowing out of the Industrial Revolution.  Fine perspective, interesting composition.  Lush hour of the day.  I like the pink-purple sparkling on the water.', '2018-06-07 23:37:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(7570755, 1214748, 173844, '<td valign="top">As the river flows, so does the sky, maybe in opposite directions.  I like this mirrored, curious tension. The Island of Trees reminds me of a riverboat negotiating the foamy current.  There''s more going on here than first meets the eye.</td>', 'As the river flows, so does the sky, maybe in opposite directions.  I like this mirrored, curious tension. The Island of Trees reminds me of a riverboat negotiating the foamy current.  There''s more going on here than first meets the eye.', '2018-06-07 23:37:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(7570756, 1215235, 173844, '<td valign="top">Interesting dynamic tension in this elegant still-life.  The shells feel both arbitrary and apt.  The colors are harmonious.  Has a subtle oomph.</td>', 'Interesting dynamic tension in this elegant still-life.  The shells feel both arbitrary and apt.  The colors are harmonious.  Has a subtle oomph.', '2018-06-07 23:42:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(7570758, 1215125, 173844, '<td valign="top">Beautifully detailed squirrels messing with our heads.  You can see their individual appearances.  Fine capture.  Keep squaring them and you''ll have some fantastic wallpaper.</td>', 'Beautifully detailed squirrels messing with our heads.  You can see their individual appearances.  Fine capture.  Keep squaring them and you''ll have some fantastic wallpaper.', '2018-06-07 23:48:21.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(7570759, 1214761, 173844, '<td valign="top">The even flow on top appears to be man-made, but it still tumbles in a lovely manner.  I like the compact composition that fits everything in --  falls, pool, rocky continuation of the river, massive vertical rock and delicate foliage.</td>', 'The even flow on top appears to be man-made, but it still tumbles in a lovely manner.  I like the compact composition that fits everything in --  falls, pool, rocky continuation of the river, massive vertical rock and delicate foliage.', '2018-06-07 23:53:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(7570760, 1214958, 173844, '<td valign="top">You sure have their attention.  Was neon involved?  It''s a lovely image, the deer being soft, direct, curious, innocent and seemingly untroubled.  The depth of field makes the picture.</td>', 'You sure have their attention.  Was neon involved?  It''s a lovely image, the deer being soft, direct, curious, innocent and seemingly untroubled.  The depth of field makes the picture.', '2018-06-08 00:01:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(7570762, 1215125, 185714, '<td valign="top">Awesome capture.</td>', 'Awesome capture.', '2018-06-08 00:05:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(7570763, 1215200, 173844, '<td valign="top">Fine moment of capture of this amazing creature doing it''s thing.  What must it feel like to be strolling along and then WHAP!, end of the line?  The detail and colors are compelling, as is the actual denouement.</td>', 'Fine moment of capture of this amazing creature doing it''s thing.  What must it feel like to be strolling along and then WHAP!, end of the line?  The detail and colors are compelling, as is the actual denouement.', '2018-06-08 00:06:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(7570764, 1215152, 173844, '<td valign="top">Evocative image and well-composed.  The colors are harmonious and light and shadow are pleasantly distributed.  I''m a bit confused about the chair.  Is it alone or does it symbolize an absent person''s aloneness?  Also, it seems to be rather conspicuously set there to achieve the effect.  These niggling doubts temper my affection for an otherwise strong shot.</td>', 'Evocative image and well-composed.  The colors are harmonious and light and shadow are pleasantly distributed.  I''m a bit confused about the chair.  Is it alone or does it symbolize an absent person''s aloneness?  Also, it seems to be rather conspicuously set there to achieve the effect.  These niggling doubts temper my affection for an otherwise strong shot.', '2018-06-08 00:16:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(7570765, 1215230, 173844, '<td valign="top">Nice sharp picture of this handsome bird.  Fills the frame nicely with some green bokeh for context.  By the way, it''s roseate.</td>', 'Nice sharp picture of this handsome bird.  Fills the frame nicely with some green bokeh for context.  By the way, it''s roseate.', '2018-06-08 00:20:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(7570767, 1214812, 173844, '<td valign="top">Interesting gentleman in a polished pose.  I like how he grips his lapels.  An impressive run of medals.  He fills the frame nicely, and his elbow is neatly clipped off (not a criticism).  Reminds me of Gene Shalit.</td>', 'Interesting gentleman in a polished pose.  I like how he grips his lapels.  An impressive run of medals.  He fills the frame nicely, and his elbow is neatly clipped off (not a criticism).  Reminds me of Gene Shalit.', '2018-06-08 00:30:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(7570768, 1215225, 173844, '<td valign="top">The overall busyness actually has a strong rectilinear structure.  Amidst that structure and clutter calmly resides this gentleman looking at his phone, seemingly detached from the moment.  The image has a an inner balance.</td>', 'The overall busyness actually has a strong rectilinear structure.  Amidst that structure and clutter calmly resides this gentleman looking at his phone, seemingly detached from the moment.  The image has a an inner balance.', '2018-06-08 00:35:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(7570769, 1214899, 173844, '<td valign="top">A brief story succinctly expressed.  A comical balance stripped of artifice.</td>', 'A brief story succinctly expressed.  A comical balance stripped of artifice.', '2018-06-08 00:37:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(7570770, 1214860, 173844, '<td valign="top">Her expression has a Mona Lisa ambiguity, fleeting amusement and patience under interruption.  It''s hard to resolve, and leaves me feeling unsettled.  I''m  guessing she has a complex inner life.  Interesting.</td>', 'Her expression has a Mona Lisa ambiguity, fleeting amusement and patience under interruption.  It''s hard to resolve, and leaves me feeling unsettled.  I''m  guessing she has a complex inner life.  Interesting.', '2018-06-08 00:43:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(7570771, 1215110, 173844, '<td valign="top">Very pretty spray of flowers and buds.  Terrific depth of field.  The composition is elegantly centered.  I like this a lot (as does my wife).</td>', 'Very pretty spray of flowers and buds.  Terrific depth of field.  The composition is elegantly centered.  I like this a lot (as does my wife).', '2018-06-08 00:47:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(7570773, 1215220, 173844, '<td valign="top">Poignant image that''s well-composed and captures his emotion.</td>', 'Poignant image that''s well-composed and captures his emotion.', '2018-06-08 00:48:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(7570775, 1214661, 185714, '<td valign="top">Beautiful iconic lone tree.  Love the tones.</td>', 'Beautiful iconic lone tree.  Love the tones.', '2018-06-08 00:49:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(7570776, 1215211, 173844, '<td valign="top">Is that a glass drying off?  A quiet, ghostly mystery that I find satisfying.</td>', 'Is that a glass drying off?  A quiet, ghostly mystery that I find satisfying.', '2018-06-08 00:51:08.000000', NULL, 1),
