(7570802, 1214996, 114285, '<td valign="top">One of the best photos Ive seen in a free study in a long time. I remember seeing a lot of those developments as we landed in Dubai, and I took a few shots. I nearly thought about entering one for a free study also. Mind you it was nothing compared to your image. <br/> <br/>Congratulations   on your first blue in a free study, I thought you wouldve already arrived at that goal, but it was obviously a red or yellow.</td>', 'One of the best photos Ive seen in a free study in a long time. I remember seeing a lot of those developments as we landed in Dubai, and I took a few shots. I nearly thought about entering one for a free study also. Mind you it was nothing compared to your image.  Congratulations   on your first blue in a free study, I thought you wouldve already arrived at that goal, but it was obviously a red or yellow.', '2018-06-08 01:20:26.000000', NULL, 0),
