(7570805, 1215125, 114285, '<td valign="top">I was sure this was Sara, well done.  Tough competition this month, you might have won any other time.</td>', 'I was sure this was Sara, well done.  Tough competition this month, you might have won any other time.', '2018-06-08 01:23:53.000000', NULL, 0),
