(7570838, 1215194, 236773, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by streetpigeon:</b></div><hr/><i> This structure always seemed jarring to me, but here it''s given a sympathetic softness by the time of day and your interpretation.  The sky is beautiful.   Nice work. </i></td></tr></table> <br/>Thanks for your comment. Yeah, its the time of the day that makes this shot for me as well.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2018-06-08 01:56:31.</i></td>', 'Originally posted by streetpigeon: This structure always seemed jarring to me, but here it''s given a sympathetic softness by the time of day and your interpretation.  The sky is beautiful.   Nice work.  Thanks for your comment. Yeah, its the time of the day that makes this shot for me as well.', '2018-06-08 02:49:37.000000', '2018-06-08 02:56:31.000000', 0),
