(7570869, 1214996, 38032, '<td valign="top">WOw. I never got a chance to vote on this challenge. WHne I saw this image I immediately thought this was an expert editing challenge. Fantastic and well-deserved sky-high score.</td>', 'WOw. I never got a chance to vote on this challenge. WHne I saw this image I immediately thought this was an expert editing challenge. Fantastic and well-deserved sky-high score.', '2018-06-08 10:22:23.000000', NULL, 0),
