(7571224, 1215167, 25024, '<td valign="top">Hello from the critique club<br/> <br/>A very pleasing contribution to the open challenge<br/> <br/>An excellent macro Gin Tay, perfectly executed. Great control of the tiny DOF with good sharp detail where it matters most. Good lighting and colour throughout, I love the iridescence on the wings. This is not an easy shot to get right, you''ve done well to get this excellent result, well done</td>', 'Hello from the critique club A very pleasing contribution to the open challenge An excellent macro Gin Tay, perfectly executed. Great control of the tiny DOF with good sharp detail where it matters most. Good lighting and colour throughout, I love the iridescence on the wings. This is not an easy shot to get right, you''ve done well to get this excellent result, well done', '2018-06-11 17:23:38.000000', NULL, 0),
(7571263, 1215167, 185714, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by sidpixel:</b></div><hr/><i> Hello from the critique club<br/> <br/>A very pleasing contribution to the open challenge<br/> <br/>An excellent macro Gin Tay, perfectly executed. Great control of the tiny DOF with good sharp detail where it matters most. Good lighting and colour throughout, I love the iridescence on the wings. This is not an easy shot to get right, you''ve done well to get this excellent result, well done </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Thank you so much for reviewing &amp; analyzing the tiny details. <br/> <br/>Truly appreciated your comments.<br/> <br/>cheers<br/>gin :)<br/> <br/></td>', 'Originally posted by sidpixel: Hello from the critique club A very pleasing contribution to the open challenge An excellent macro Gin Tay, perfectly executed. Great control of the tiny DOF with good sharp detail where it matters most. Good lighting and colour throughout, I love the iridescence on the wings. This is not an easy shot to get right, you''ve done well to get this excellent result, well done   Thank you so much for reviewing & analyzing the tiny details.  Truly appreciated your comments. cheersgin :) ', '2018-06-12 05:12:21.000000', NULL, 0),
